{"synopsis":"Jika malaikat maut memanggil namamu 3 kali Kau akan dibawa ke dunia bawah\nHyeokryeon Mugang Hyeokryeon Mugang Hyeokryeon Mu Bajingan Aku ingin hidup lebih lama Enyahlah\nSetelah matimatian mencari dan memakan ramuan keabadian aku tidak menyangka tapi aku berhasil selamat Saat aku tersadar dan membuka mata ada kakekkakek tua yang berdiri di sekitarku\nDimana ini Gunung Wudang Sekte Wudang\nDan yang lebih buruk lagi aku merasuki tubuh seorang bocah pesuruh\nIni sungguh gila Aku Aku adalah orang terkuat Orang yang paling kuat Pemimpin terkuat Sekte Evil Hyeokryeon Mugang","alternative_title":"Shaman Association, Mudang Association, Path of the Shaman , 무당기협","author":"Blue Hwaram Silver Heat","artist":"","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"1308d67a-300e-43c5-8c51-05db4ca9a2e1","number":"172","chapter":"172","title":"Chapter 172","date":"2026-08-01","released":"2026-08-01","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"79ed1e91-26b6-4eed-b048-9a244b5091dc","number":"171","chapter":"171","title":"Chapter 171","date":"2026-07-18","released":"2026-07-18","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"faf11d52-637b-4bd9-bd27-a4b41c6f5f9d","number":"170","chapter":"170","title":"Chapter 170","date":"2026-07-11","released":"2026-07-11","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"5aa436fa-1693-4e16-b14c-c919f6b75d9d","number":"169","chapter":"169","title":"Chapter 169","date":"2026-07-04","released":"2026-07-04","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6e32a6c1-d037-4e44-8a2f-6bef5ec9a694","number":"168","chapter":"168","title":"Chapter 168","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"b3f9174a-fca1-4680-8a54-238a82cc047e","number":"167","chapter":"167","title":"Chapter 167","date":"2026-06-13","released":"2026-06-13","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"bff491a7-d681-4996-84f5-a70e30640a24","number":"166","chapter":"166","title":"Chapter 166","date":"2026-06-06","released":"2026-06-06","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"d453dc82-a40a-47d5-91bb-dffd319750fd","number":"165","chapter":"165","title":"Chapter 165","date":"2026-05-